# frame times on a late save (Emilia's playtest 1 save): every tab, then the corner panel
from late_playtest
wait 8
view full
wait 2
frames 8 home
shot home
expect fits
tab machine
wait 2
frames 8 machine
shot machine
expect fits
page machine 1
wait 2
frames 6 machine-upgrades
shot machine-upgrades
expect fits
tab automation
wait 2
frames 8 automation
shot automation
expect fits
tab errands
wait 2
frames 8 errands
shot errands
expect fits
tab collection
wait 2
frames 8 collection
shot collection
expect fits
click "book"
wait 2
frames 6 book
shot book
expect fits
click "toys"
wait 2
frames 6 toys
shot toys
expect fits
tab boxes
wait 2
frames 8 boxes
shot boxes
expect fits
tab adventures
wait 2
frames 8 adventures
shot adventures
expect fits
page adventures 2
wait 2
frames 8 dungeon
shot dungeon
expect fits
tab inventory
wait 2
frames 8 workbench
shot workbench
expect fits
page inventory 1
wait 2
frames 6 workbench-toys
shot workbench-toys
expect fits
page inventory 2
wait 2
frames 6 plushie
shot plushie
expect fits
tab errands
click "upgrades"
wait 2
frames 6 errand-upgrades
shot errand-upgrades
expect fits
tab home
wait 2
frames 8 home-again
shot home-again
expect fits
view corner
wait 2
frames 10 corner
shot corner
expect fits
